      "summary": "Runtime memory estimation and tracking utilities for orgii's UI surfaces (file tree, CodeMirror editors, rendered chat trees, sidebar sections), providing generic JS value size estimation, per-registry CRUD/aggregation helpers, and live WebView diagnostic collection.",
